# Controls documentation

[CONTROLS.md](CONTROLS.md) is the living inventory of all player gestures and controls.

When you add, remove, rename, or rebind any hand gesture, gamepad input, cockpit/HUD button, or Mission Control window control:

1. Update the implementation.
2. Update `CONTROLS.md` in the same change (matching section tables).
3. Do not leave stale bindings in the doc.

Primary code sources: `HandFlightController.swift`, `ControllerObserver` in `ImmersiveSpaceView.swift`, `MissionControlView.swift`, related `FlightModel` entry points.
